dmr-vocoder — an AMBE+2 (DMR, 3600x2450) compatible vocoder

All files of this repository are under the licence below, except where it says otherwise:

- the decoder (py/ambe_decoder*.py, c/*/ambe_dec.c, the parameter decoding) is ported from mbelib, and the tables
  (py/mbe_tables.py, c/*/ambe_tables.c) are generated from mbelib's headers: mbelib's ISC licence, below, applies
  to those parts too;
- data/thchs30/: test sentences of the THCHS-30 corpus (Dong Wang, Xuewei Zhang, Zhiyong Zhang, "THCHS-30: A Free
  Chinese Speech Corpus", 2015), from https://huggingface.co/datasets/FluidInference/THCHS-30-tests, under the
  Apache License 2.0 (data/thchs30/README.md).

AMBE+2 is DVSI's patented technology: this licence grants no patent rights. See README.en.md.

